{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>慈雲山有男童墮樓不治。今日（12日）上午8時31分，警方接獲慈正邨正旭樓保安報案，指發現一名男童倒臥在大廈對開，懷疑他從高處墮下。</p><p>救援人員到場，證實13歲事主當場不治，其死因仍有待驗屍確定。警方經初步調查，相信他從大廈一單位墮下。警方未有於現場檢獲遺書，正調查其墮樓原因。據了解，死者為正旭樓住戶。</p><figure><img alt=\"警方用帳篷遮蓋遺體調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186252585707769856174685.jpeg/-TozewnII--A1xGe2UkgyUjiu3VFXKtQxzTh68c04es\"/><figcaption>警方用帳篷遮蓋遺體調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慈正邨正旭樓。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186257774514802688925186.jpeg/K6xHUQ777f1SfLLHi9DyCoLLVr4yivPD1bP-xdWz_sU\"/><figcaption>慈正邨正旭樓。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186252834211893248562093.jpeg/7dubcb-3IkJOmMmqnFRSfx6lH9qCMp_e26YBa9umAWs\"/><figcaption>慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186252837198368768056813.jpeg/IZ3O_mxgOJbZnAKk2WLOVqYlhlaiAXNcSfAwVknwMFY\"/><figcaption>慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186252839996100608205493.jpeg/NwXZ-OTvrFsJMaQGz7tdqg_SYEHRR8fTD-Vpxw_lacc\"/><figcaption>慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186252842563145728624109.jpeg/wz_ez12jkD0G3ovw_5AjqBXEOKtNAcunAeAEMgHgBDI\"/><figcaption>慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186252845339906048357426.jpeg/Z-6TjM-SLz1Xk0tZfj4lJqqGex-00AVTMziWTjM4lk4\"/><figcaption>慈正邨正旭樓男童由高處墮下身亡。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T08:02:56.442962+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":7,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T01:44:52+00:00","fetche